cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and also cite the original
  sources of the boundaries you use (listed in docs/sources.md and in each STAC
  item's sci:citation).
type: dataset
title: "Pacific administrative boundaries: harmonised jurisdictional boundaries for 22 Pacific Island countries and territories, from EEZ to the finest public level"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
authors:
  - family-names: Lyons
    given-names: Mitchell
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Harmonised EEZ, national, subnational and census boundaries for the 22 Pacific
  Island countries and territories, delivered as GeoParquet with STAC metadata:
  per-country long tables, a Pacific-wide long table, and a planar finest
  partition of every EEZ. Each row records its source, licence, publication and
  retrieval dates and processing steps. The licence above applies to the code;
  the data keep the licences of their sources (EEZ rows: SPC, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
keywords:
  - Pacific
  - administrative boundaries
  - exclusive economic zone
  - census geography
  - GeoParquet
  - STAC
